        "body": "### What version of the Codex App are you using (From \u201cAbout Codex\u201d dialog)?\n\nI can not see About Codex please update instruction of fix your app interface\n\n### What subscription do you have?\n\nplus\n\n### What platform is your computer?\n\nMicrosoft Windows NT 10.0.26200.0 x64\n\n### What issue are you seeing?\n\nAutomatic app quit, Active task suspend, i manually reopened app to resume 5+ times till now sadly\n\nIssue is mostly with codex and browser i feel\n\n<img width=\"996\" height=\"496\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86ab5f7c-f965-4675-95f1-fd1b164cac9a\" />\n\n### What steps can reproduce the bug?\n\nUse codex inapp headless browser , get configured with other chrome and computer use mcp , the codex confuses maybe and crashes im not sure as idk how codex gets full browser use skill, but i think it still gets browser use after resuming when i reopen, btw i was on a /goal too \n\nthe exact step codex uses terminal to start browser app goes crashed maybe\n\n019f24c0-83e5-7052-a79d-1864cfc4e2ee feedback id\n\n### What is the expected behavior?\n\nthe app should not quit\n\n### Additional information\n\nplease solve immediately its critical bug disrupting workflow \n\n<img width=\"943\" height=\"617\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d39d759-13b4-4c6d-b29d-84864715aa33\" />\n\nalso wasting tokens for this browser issue past months it still cant use browser properly consumes 70% tokens on it and just goes out of tokens on real product work and also 90% of tokens it use for tests and it takes less than 0.1% in real architectural planning",
